    "observedClass": "non-rendering",
    "surface": "/admin/challenges/{challenge}?tab=gates",
    "observedBehaviour": "The Gates tab paints its header and then an empty panel; the criteria list never appears and the page request returns HTTP 500 from the evaluation-criteria endpoint.",
